+    // diverges from the C++ stepwise accumulation for non-additive day
+    // counters such as {@link org.jquantlib.daycounters.Thirty360} (USA
+    // convention) when settlement falls on the 31st of a month
+    // (test-suite/bonds.cpp::testThirty360BondWithSettlementOn31st).
